      "totalDuration": "2 yrs 1 mo",
      "description": "- Led software feature support for Altera Digital Signal Processing blocks for Stratix III by collaborating with cross-functional departments to ensure that the software release schedule is met with the features promised to customers. Architected software abstraction for Altera Digital Signal Processing blocks for Stratix III and researched hardware restrictions to prevent illegal designs.\n- Designed and constructed a framework in C++ to report the results of I/O legality checks to assist customers with debugging I/O placement errors in their design. Re-factored the I/O legality checking code to be more readable and extensible.\n- Implemented a comprehensive plan using Verilog testbenches to test the functionality of the word aligner of the high-speed transceiver in Stratix II GX devices.\n- Wrote and updated internal documentation abstraction for Altera  Digital Signal Processing block software support.\n- Created and maintained hundreds of regression tests using TCL to ensure stability and correctness of code.",
